  "body_text": "这周我们开会确定了，未来我们的单品豆的\n销售期：11天\n意味着算上物流最多3-4天的运送，客人拿到手的单品豆的烘焙日期最多是15天。\n为什么要明确这个天数\n豆子一定要养到一定的程度才会好喝\n目前我们跟踪测试下来传统处理的豆子，水洗或者日晒在10-13天开始才会容易出完整的风味；偏发酵或者酵母特殊处理的豆子会需要更长的养豆期才会完全绽放它的美丽。\nFigure 3-Representive CO\n2\ndegassing kinetics data (symbols) at 25 °C for coffee beans roasted using different temperature-time conditions.\nSolid line represents the best fit of Weibull distribution model, showing its goodness of fit to the experimental data. HTST: high-temperature-short-time; LTLT: low-temperature-long-time; D: dark roast degree; M: medium roast degree.\n来源：Effect of Roasting Conditions on Carbon Dioxide Degassing Behavior in Coffee\n线上我们会在标题里标注烘焙日期批次信息，如果对烘焙日期有要求的，请和客服联系确认。",
  "body_html": "<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content autoTypeSetting24psection\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; \">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          这周我们开会确定了，未来我们的单品豆的\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;font-size: 14px;\">\n            销售期：11天\n           </span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          意味着算上物流最多3-4天的运送，客人拿到手的单品豆的烘焙日期最多是15天。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          为什么要明确这个天数\n         </span>\n</section>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            豆子一定要养到一定的程度才会好喝\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            目前我们跟踪测试下来传统处理的豆子，水洗或者日晒在10-13天开始才会容易出完整的风味；偏发酵或者酵母特殊处理的豆子会需要更长的养豆期才会完全绽放它的美丽。\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7TDcibg0y6YK1Y1pSoQrITDq98HERhlktVhzTRbgsEh219GlKk7edYNOS729QyB6w0p8fMCMbVJy4Q/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-left: 18pt;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\";'>\n           Figure 3-Representive CO\n          </span>\n<sub>\n<span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\";vertical-align: sub;'>\n            2\n           </span>\n</sub>\n<span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\";'>\n           degassing kinetics data (symbols) at 25 °C for coffee beans roasted using different temperature-time conditions.\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">\n</span>\n<span style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\";'>\n           Solid line represents the best fit of Weibull distribution model, showing its goodness of fit to the experimental data. HTST: high-temperature-short-time; LTLT: low-temperature-long-time; D: dark roast degree; M: medium roast degree.\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(136, 136, 136);font-size: 14px;\">\n          来源：Effect of Roasting Conditions on Carbon Dioxide Degassing Behavior in Coffee\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          线上我们会在标题里标注烘焙日期批次信息，如果对烘焙日期有要求的，请和客服联系确认。\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n</div>",
